# Ayush project store — payments
# Payments use your UPI ID (FamPay / GPay / PhonePe).
# There is no .env needed — set it in the admin panel:
#   Admin -> Settings -> UPI payments -> "Your UPI ID" + "Name shown on QR"
# Members pay to that UPI ID from any UPI app, enter the transaction UTR,
# and you approve the order in Admin -> Orders to unlock their download.
